\begin_deeper
\begin_layout Enumerate
בי-לינאריות:
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{align*}
\left\langle v\mid w+u\right\rangle  & =\left\langle v\mid w\right\rangle +\left\langle v\mid u\right\rangle \\
\left\langle v\mid\lambda\cdot w\right\rangle  & =\lambda\cdot\left\langle v\mid w\right\rangle \\
\left\langle v+u\mid w\right\rangle  & =\left\langle v\mid w\right\rangle +\left\langle u\mid w\right\rangle \\
\left\langle \lambda\cdot v\mid w\right\rangle  & =\lambda\cdot\left\langle v\mid w\right\rangle 
\end{align*}

